// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_PROCESSING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P482587300" "Wot's this? Gett'n antsy are we?"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_PROCESSING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3226526721" "Just a few dozen more pages and we'll be on our way."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_PROCESSING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1691244162" "Keep yer knick'rs on, we'll be 'ere awhile yet."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_PROCESSING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1232695640" "Mmm... right, right..."

// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_PROCESSING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3096853809" "Wot's all this, then?"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_PROCESSING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2676831651" "Right! That does 't!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_PROCESSING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2354513280" "Wha? My flick'rs!<em>You'll pay fer that!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_PROCESSING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1038333118" "Wait! You're not dead! 'How's 'bout we 'elp you with that?"

// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_DIGGING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P245585155" "Keep calm down there. We'll 'ave you up soon 'nough."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_DIGGING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3220851604" "Aye, we 'ear you down there an'll get t' you soon."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_DIGGING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2699013706" "Come on, men! Wax is a-wast'n."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_DIGGING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3187172796" "Pick up th' pace, boys. We don't want our candles burn'n out now."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_DIGGING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2202052227" "Come, boys, we 'avn't got all night now."

// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_DIGGING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P889345207" "Wot's all this, then??"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_DIGGING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3506244698" "Right, that does 't!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_DIGGING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1105056014" "Take five, boys."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_DIGGING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4052376610" "Extra wax goes to th' fella who brings me th' lgiht o' this 'un!"

// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_WAITING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P140396730" "They 'ave t'come out some time...<em>'n when they do..."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_WAITING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1076259404" "'Urry up in there! Some o' us got places t' be!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_WAITING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2127571515" "Bloody late...<em>Bloody again."

// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_WAITING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P289102107" "And 'ere I thought this night was gonna be a slow'un."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_WAITING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4136153799" "Well this ought liven things up o' bit!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_WAITING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2330860327" "Let's 'ave at 't then!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_WAITING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1152060113" "Per'aps I won't be late aft'r all."

// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_TRAPPED_NPC_TEXT :
"P2915172929" "I won't come out! You can't make me!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_TRAPPED_NPC_TEXT :
"P2612418037" "Nope... not gonna happen."

// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1141477103" "Smell'at, boys? Fresh-cut roses...<em>Must be new flick'rs about."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P817649999" "Ears t' noses, gents. I 'eard a death rattle somewhere near, time t' get t' work."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P201094843" "'Ey boys, you smell 'dem roses? Must be some freshies 'round 'ere. New arrivals."

// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2110126357" "Looks like some un's a li'l lost.<em>Let's be good neighbors an' show'em th' way!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P757638305" "Double wax goes t' th' man that brings down this fool'ardy travel'r."

// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_FISHING_FISH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2998937988" "...Be that as 't may, I'm rath'r enjoy'n meself 'ere."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_FISHING_FISH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2254448970" "I gots plenty o' wax, boss. No need t' fly off th' 'andle."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_FISHING_FISH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2520282296" "Feh! You're just ornery ye 'aven't thought o' this yerself."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_FISHING_FISH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3688942610" "Wot's with all th' yell'n, boss? Don't be like that, now."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_FISHING_FISH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2494121317" "Wot? I can't 'ave a break but you can? Anyways, we do all th' work."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_FISHING_FISH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3719618732" "Wot? This? A flick'r went on 'bouts 't... Call'd 't fish'n."

// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_FISHING_YELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P316342050" "We'll I 'ad t' see't t' believe't!<em>Really! ...I expect this kind o' be'avior from a lowly guide, but not one o' you."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_FISHING_YELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P889551505" "That's 't! Wrap't up! ...I'll not lose anoth'r drop on account o' you!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_FISHING_YELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2320097825" "Again with this nonsense!? Back t' work wit you!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_FISHING_YELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2681955544" "That's 't! I'm demot'n you back t' grave sniffer!<em>Off t' Th' Digs with you!"

// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_BREAKOUT_TEXT :
"P1864834987" "Reluctant li'l flick'r this'un is..."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_BREAKOUT_TEXT :
"P3695159555" "Stubborn as stones some flick'rs are..."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_BREAKOUT_TEXT :
"P348907510" "'Nother 'un o'em problem flick'rs refuse'n t'leave it's car."

// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_FIGHT_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P372103650" "These ain't our typical flick'rs, boys.<em>Let's put 'em back 'n th' dirt."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_FIGHT_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1062229192" "Roll 'em sleeves up, boys! These roses 'ave gone bad!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_FIGHT_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4045926756" "Come now, flick'rs, don't be scared...<em>Just be glad you iddn't one o' em!"

// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_DIG_SOLO_TEXT :
"P2594964129" "After this 'un, no more grave sniff'n fer me! I'll be promote'd fer sure."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_DIG_SOLO_TEXT :
"P4000844686" "If I c'n just top off me candle with one more flick'r... I could knock off early t'night."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_DIG_SOLO_TEXT :
"P2765389234" "S'got t' be more down 'ere somewheres!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_DIG_SOLO_TEXT :
"P844928195" "Upsy Daisy..."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_DIG_SOLO_TEXT :
"P3189300701" "Oooh... I'm gett'n reeeal good at find'n dem flick'rs."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_DIG_SOLO_TEXT :
"P1712651959" "Come now, love. Don't be shy."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_DIG_SOLO_TEXT :
"P864294734" "This 'un's gonna be all mine!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_DIG_SOLO_TEXT :
"P746271376" "Lovely even'n for night dig'n..."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_DIG_SOLO_TEXT :
"P4169212788" "Ooh, I can smell 'er now... must be gett'n close!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_DIG_SOLO_TEXT :
"P2442682602" "When, o' when will I get to dem lovely bones?"

// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P412247087" "Wot!?<em>You 'ad a 'eavy-set flick'r with 'nough wax fer th' two o' us?<en>An' you let 'er get away!?"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1975141482" "I don't care wot any'un thinks. I gots more wax on me candle than th' lot o' you."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3853084637" "Ain't 'nuff flick'rs 'ere for all o' us.<em>...makes me worry o'bit."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P270769232" "Oh, I feel like fight'n..."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1112735076" "Been awhile since I seen some flick'rs about.<em>'haps some 'un should go 'n patrol."

// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_DIG_SOLO_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2839302041" "Come t' ruin my even'n, eh?"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_DIG_SOLO_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3261332215" "'Ey!<em>Wot's all this, then!?"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_DIG_SOLO_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2181457416" "That does't! Put'm up!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_DIG_SOLO_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3209691116" "Sneakin' up on us, eh?"

// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_CAJOLE_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P774949605" "Where's that li'l bugg'r? ...'ere not two ticks ago."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_CAJOLE_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1774678323" "Hmm... I smells a thief. Bett'r keep'n eye'n my flick'rs."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_CAJOLE_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P805196968" "If I find that li'l bugg'r I'm go'n take ev'ry last drop o' wax 'e got's on 'em!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_CAJOLE_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1411841563" "Stay close t' me, li'l flick'rs.<em>...Me thinks I smells a theif about."

// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_CAJOLE_GUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4285934909" "Com'n t' steal me souls away, are we?"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_CAJOLE_GUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P563816710" "Right! I'll do you fer that!"

// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_CAJOLE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P966318984" "Come now, li'l flick'r. I may 'ave a BIG smile, but I ain't much fer bite'n."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_CAJOLE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1903840004" "'Ey der Flick'r, let me 'elp you on ya way now."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_CAJOLE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2257915205" "Don't you worry none 'bout me tend'n me candle o' bit with a spark or two from your flame."

// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_CAJOLE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4044365898" "AW! Ye ruin'd me ruse, you!<em>You'll pay fer that!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_CAJOLE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4177508250" "Not again with this!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_CAJOLE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3829951544" "Drat!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_CAJOLE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P971954698" "Oh, bloody 'ell!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_CAJOLE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1823183632" "C'mere, you!"

// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_SLACKING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3800850307" "Th' bullocks with work! I gots me 'nough wax 'til morn'n time."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_SLACKING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3899689577" "Nice t' kick off fer a bit."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_SLACKING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3554637055" "Bett'r not let bossman see me 'ere like this."

// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_SLACKING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P426930329" "Nap time's over me thinks!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_SLACKING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1885056768" "S'ppose I bett'r gets up, then."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_SLACKING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P849650508" "Aw!<em>Was 'av'n me th' nicest dream 'til you show'd up!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_SLACKING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P329732732" "Who's there!?"

// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_LANTERNS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3295326807" "I sees someth'n up a'ead!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_LANTERNS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3709639257" "Keep 'em peel'd, boys!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_LANTERNS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3816329085" "If yer gonna be a caboose, get'n th' back!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_LANTERNS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3832703495" "Keep up, back there!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_LANTERNS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3456581903" "Careful now... Me thinks we's got company up a'ead."

// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_LANTERNS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3845046758" "Whoa, there!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_LANTERNS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P886290202" "You'll 'ave t'do bett'r than that!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_LANTERNS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3163393012" "Aha! I saw you all along!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_LANTERNS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3149102854" "There you are, li'l bugg'r!"
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_LANTERNS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1201314371" "Let's 'ave at 't, then!"

